  ! CW (condenser) loop supply setpoint: wet bulb + 3°C approach, clamped [18, 29°C]
  !   Prevents over-cooling in winter (chiller compressor protection floor: 18°C)
  !   Allows reset above 29°C in peak summer when wet bulb > 26°C

