  ! ── Zone air-side equipment ────────────────────────────────────
  !  IdealLoads removed.  Residual zone load (5% ITE air leakage +
  !  6% UPS losses + lights + envelope ≈ 230 kW peak) is now handled
  !  by ZoneHVAC:FourPipeFanCoil "DC CRAH", drawing CHW from the
  !  existing CHW Loop demand side (parallel to the ITE liquid coil).
  !  Fan electricity → Fans:Electricity meter; coil load → CHW chiller
  !  → Cooling:Electricity meter.  DistrictCooling is no longer used.

  ZoneHVAC:EquipmentList,
    DataCenter ZN Equipment List,        !- Name
    SequentialLoad,                      !- Load Distribution Scheme
    ZoneHVAC:FourPipeFanCoil,            !- Zone Equipment 1 Object Type
    DC CRAH,                             !- Zone Equipment 1 Name
    1, 1, , ;

